@startuml
title A timeout does not say whether the command ran

participant "PC" as PC
participant "MCU" as MCU

PC -> MCU : request id = 42
MCU -> MCU : executes the command
MCU -->x PC : response lost in transit
PC -> PC : timeout expires

note over PC #FFDDDD
  The PC only knows it heard nothing. Retrying
  is safe only if the method is idempotent.
end note
@enduml
